@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 1. Login (copy "token" from the response into @token below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@example.com", "password": "Demo@123" }

###
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### My organizations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/my-tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tenant 1 inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 1

### Tenant 2 inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 2

### Tenant 1 asking for a tenant 2 product (id 5 = Smartphone) -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 1

### Create (tenantId in the body is ignored)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Webcam", "description": "HD webcam", "quantity": 5, "price": 2500 }
